cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WoL data, code or protocols, please cite the article below."
title: "WoL: Reference Phylogeny for Bacterial and Archaeal Genomes"
abstract: >-
  A reference phylogeny for bacterial and archaeal genomes, built from 10,575
  genomes using 381 global marker genes, together with the genome catalog,
  curated taxonomy, protocols and analysis code.
url: "https://biocore.github.io/wol/"
